sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant R as DebitCardController
    participant U as PayWithDebitCardUseCaseImpl
    participant P as AccountPersistencePort
    participant E as DomainEventPublisher
    participant K as KafkaDomainEventPublisher
    participant KAFKA as Kafka (topic debit-card-payments)
    participant TS as transaction-service

    C->>R: POST /api/v1/debit-cards/{id}/payments
    R->>U: pay(cardId, amount)
    U->>P: debitAccount(accountId, amount)
    P-->>U: saldo actualizado
    U->>E: publish("debit-card-payments", DebitCardPaymentEvent)
    E->>K: publish(event)
    K->>KAFKA: evento {accountId, cardId, amount, timestamp}
    KAFKA-->>TS: consume (@KafkaListener groupId=transaction-service)
    TS->>TS: registra Movement WITHDRAWAL (ProductType.ACCOUNT)
    U-->>R: resultado
    R-->>C: 200 OK
